WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.261
Unbiased bases in dimension six.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.273
Two more bases would need this pattern:

3
00:00:05.273 --> 00:00:07.307
two cliques, every cross pair unbiased.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.471
Cover all candidates with tiny balls, rule

5
00:00:11.471 --> 00:00:14.043
out pairs, then search every remaining pattern.

6
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.077
Claimed: exactly three, by computer search.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.079
Lean checks part.
